    "corrected_red_role": "The red peg cannot be removed by a plain and cannot remove a plain, but that makes it useful rather than inert: cross-name jumps preserve both pieces and create a reusable two-peg walking pair.",
    "definitive_answer": "The carrier rail networks are disconnected, but the level is solvable because peg reachability is connected through cross-name leapfrog relays."
